#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:2
msgid "Visualization"
msgstr "可视化"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:6
msgid ""
"Visualizers let you inspect, debug, and record a running simulation. Isaac "
"Lab offers five options, from lightweight viewers to the Isaac Sim viewport."
" You can also view camera-sensor output in the streaming camera panel."
msgstr ""
"可视化器用于检查、调试和录制正在运行的仿真。Isaac Lab 提供五种选择，从轻量查看器到 Isaac Sim "
"视口均有覆盖。您还可在流式相机面板中查看相机传感器输出。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:10
msgid ""
"Try :ref:`Franka cube stacking <interactive-demo-franka-stack>` for a "
"compact simulation running directly in the browser. Orbit its camera, watch "
"the scripted grasp, or control the end effector in Manual mode."
msgstr ""
"可试用直接在浏览器中运行的 :ref:`Franka 方块堆叠 <interactive-demo-franka-stack>` "
"仿真：旋转相机观察、观看脚本控制的抓取，或在手动模式下控制末端执行器。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:112
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:114
msgid ""
"Pass ``--viz`` to any train command to launch a visualizer. ``--visualizer``"
" is an equivalent alias."
msgstr "在任意训练命令中加入 ``--viz`` 即可启动可视化器。 ``--visualizer`` 是等效的别名。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:137
msgid ""
"Most tasks default to a PhysX backend, which requires Isaac Sim. If it isn't"
" installed yet, add ``--extra isaacsim`` to the ``uv run`` commands above; "
"see :ref:`installation-optional-extras` for details."
msgstr ""
"大多数任务默认使用 PhysX 后端，需要安装 Isaac Sim。如果尚未安装，请在上述 ``uv run`` 命令中加入 ``--extra "
"isaacsim`` ；详情见 :ref:`installation-optional-extras` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:143
msgid ""
"``train`` and ``play`` run without a visualizer unless ``--viz`` is passed, "
"while packaged demos and examples open their own default visualizer. ``--viz"
" none`` turns it off."
msgstr ""
"``train`` 和 ``play`` 仅在传入 ``--viz`` 时启动可视化器；内置演示和示例则会打开各自的默认可视化器。``--viz "
"none`` 可以关闭可视化器。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:146
msgid ""
"For combining visualizers, running headless, and other common use cases, see"
" `Usage`_ below."
msgstr "关于组合使用可视化器、无界面运行等常见场景，请参阅下文的 `使用方法 <Usage_>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:149
msgid "Visualizer presets"
msgstr "可视化器预设"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:151
msgid ""
"Task commands accept ``visualizer=newton_gl``, ``visualizer=kit``, or "
"``visualizer=rerun,newton_gl``. ``--viz`` and ``--visualizer`` are aliases "
"for the same selection. ``visualizer=none`` disables viewers. Selection "
"happens during configuration composition, before choosing process runtimes "
"or creating the scene."
msgstr ""
"任务命令接受 ``visualizer=newton_gl``、``visualizer=kit`` 或 "
"``visualizer=rerun,newton_gl``。``--viz`` 和 ``--visualizer`` "
"是同一选择的别名，``visualizer=none`` 则禁用查看器。选择在配置组合阶段完成，早于进程运行时选择和场景创建。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:156
msgid ""
"Task scripts can declare alternatives with "
"``isaaclab_tasks.utils.presets.MultiBackendVisualizerCfg``. Customize them "
"with configured instances; no preset subclass is needed. Resolve them in the"
" script before calling ``launch_simulation``:"
msgstr ""
"任务脚本可通过 ``isaaclab_tasks.utils.presets.MultiBackendVisualizerCfg`` "
"声明备选项，并用配置实例定制，无需创建预设子类。应在脚本调用 ``launch_simulation`` 前解析这些选项："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:175
msgid ""
"Task entry points perform this selection through ``resolve_task_config`` "
"when given ``visualizer=newton_gl`` or ``--viz newton_gl``. The launcher and"
" simulation receive concrete configs."
msgstr ""
"当传入 ``visualizer=newton_gl`` 或 ``--viz newton_gl`` 时，任务入口通过 "
"``resolve_task_config`` 完成选择。启动器和仿真接收的都是具体配置。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:178
msgid ""
"After task composition, ``visualizer_cfgs`` contains the selected concrete "
"config or list of configs. Standalone scripts can supply concrete visualizer"
" configs directly, without task presets. Viewer implementations are imported"
" only when constructed."
msgstr ""
"任务配置组合完成后，``visualizer_cfgs`` "
"包含所选的具体配置或配置列表。独立脚本可直接提供具体可视化器配置，无需任务预设。查看器实现仅在构造时导入。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:182
msgid ""
"For ``--video`` without a selected capture-capable viewer, launch selects a "
"headless Newton GL producer. ``visualizer=none`` disables windows; recording"
" still runs its producer on demand. Use ``--video sensor:<name>`` to record "
"a scene camera without a visualizer producer."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--video`` 时，若未选择支持捕获的查看器，启动过程会选择无窗口 Newton GL "
"作为图像来源。``visualizer=none`` 关闭窗口，但录制仍会按需运行其图像生成器。使用 ``--video sensor:<name>``"
" 可直接录制场景相机，无需可视化器提供图像。"

