msgid "ViserVisualizerCfg source"
msgstr "ViserVisualizerCfg 源代码"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0 source/concepts/visualization.rst:900
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:921
msgid "Newton RTX"
msgstr "Newton RTX"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:352
msgid ""
"The **experimental** Newton RTX visualizer, launched with ``--viz "
"newton_rtx``, uses the OVRTX path-tracer for photorealistic rendering "
"without a Kit process. It is slightly slower than the Newton GL visualizer "
"due to the cost of high-quality RTX rendering."
msgstr ""
"Newton RTX 可视化器目前处于 **实验阶段** ，使用 ``--viz newton_rtx`` 启动。它通过 OVRTX "
"路径追踪器实现照片级真实感渲染，无需启动 Kit 进程。由于高质量 RTX 渲染的开销较大，其速度略低于 Newton GL 可视化器。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:366
msgid ""
"OVRTX path-traced rendering for photorealistic, physically-based lighting"
msgstr "使用 OVRTX 路径追踪，实现照片级真实感、基于物理的光照"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:370
msgid ""
"The following features are not yet supported and will be added in a future "
"release: live plots and rigid-body dragging. Visualization markers, camera "
"selection, scene-camera display, pause controls, and headless recording are "
"supported."
msgstr "以下功能尚未支持，将在后续版本中加入：实时曲线和刚体拖拽。目前已支持可视化标记、相机选择、场景相机显示、暂停控制和无窗口录制。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg source"
msgstr "NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg 源代码"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "Shared window options"
msgstr "通用窗口选项"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:410
msgid ""
"Newton RTX (OVRTX) is a kitless renderer and cannot be used in the same "
"process as Kit (``presets=isaacsim_physx``). ``presets=ovphysx`` is itself "
"kitless and works fine with Newton RTX. Use ``presets=newton_mjwarp,ovrtx`` "
"or ``presets=ovphysx,ovrtx`` with ``--viz newton_rtx``, or switch to ``--viz"
" newton_gl``, ``--viz viser``, ``--viz rerun``, or ``--viz kit`` with a Kit-"
"compatible physics backend."
msgstr ""
"Newton RTX（OVRTX）是不依赖 Kit 的渲染器，不能与 Kit（ ``presets=isaacsim_physx`` "
"）在同一进程中使用。 ``presets=ovphysx`` 本身也不依赖 Kit，可以与 Newton RTX 配合使用。请将 ``--viz "
"newton_rtx`` 与 ``presets=newton_mjwarp,ovrtx`` 或 ``presets=ovphysx,ovrtx`` "
"搭配，或者改用 ``--viz newton_gl`` 、 ``--viz viser`` 、 ``--viz rerun`` ；也可以在兼容 Kit "
"的物理后端下使用 ``--viz kit`` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0 source/concepts/visualization.rst:903
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:923
msgid "Rerun"
msgstr "Rerun"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:418
msgid ""
"Like Viser, `Rerun <https://rerun.io/>`_ streams simulation state to a local"
" web server, for remote monitoring, timeline playback, and recording to "
"``.rrd`` files."
msgstr ""
"与 Viser 类似， `Rerun <https://rerun.io/>`_ 将仿真状态传输到本地 Web 服务器，支持远程观察、时间线回放和录制为"
" ``.rrd`` 文件。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:431
msgid "Timeline scrubbing and playback of ``.rrd`` recordings"
msgstr "在时间线上拖动定位，并回放 ``.rrd`` 录制文件"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:432
msgid ""
"**Pause Rendering** and **Reset Episode** controls via the ImGui sidebar"
msgstr "ImGui 侧栏中的 **Pause Rendering** （暂停渲染）和 **Reset Episode** （重置回合）控件"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:436
msgid ""
"The native Play/Pause timeline controls in the Rerun visualizer UI do not "
"work while visualizing a live simulation or training run. They are hidden by"
" default, but Rerun's dock panel UI can still be used to reveal them; when "
"revealed, clicking them has no effect. Use Isaac Lab's own **Pause "
"Rendering** / **Reset Episode** controls instead. The timeline controls are "
"only meaningful when replaying a saved ``.rrd`` recording."
msgstr ""
"在实时查看仿真或训练过程时，Rerun 界面原生的时间线播放/暂停控件不起作用。这些控件默认隐藏，但仍可通过 Rerun "
"的停靠面板界面显示；即使显示出来，点击也不会生效。请使用 Isaac Lab 自身的 **Pause Rendering** （暂停渲染）和 "
"**Reset Episode** （重置回合）控件。时间线控件仅在回放已保存的 ``.rrd`` 文件时有效。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:444
msgid ""
"A highlighted URL is printed to the terminal before training begins. Ctrl-"
"click it to open the viewer, or set ``open_browser=True`` to open it "
"automatically."
msgstr "训练开始前，终端会突出显示访问地址。按住 Ctrl 点击即可打开查看器，也可以设置 ``open_browser=True`` 自动打开。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "RerunVisualizerCfg source"
msgstr "RerunVisualizerCfg 源代码"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0 source/concepts/visualization.rst:905
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:924
msgid "Kit"
msgstr "Kit"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:486
msgid ""
"The Kit visualizer embeds Isaac Lab inside a Kit process, providing access "
"to the full Isaac Sim USD stage, RTX renderer, and GUI tooling. It has the "
"highest startup and runtime overhead of the five visualizers."
msgstr ""
"Kit 可视化器将 Isaac Lab 嵌入 Kit 进程，可以访问完整的 Isaac Sim USD 舞台、RTX 渲染器和图形界面工具。在这 5 "
"种可视化器中，它的启动和运行开销最大。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:500
msgid ""
"Direct access to the Isaac Sim USD stage for inspecting and editing prims at"
" runtime"
msgstr "可直接访问 Isaac Sim USD 舞台，在运行时查看和编辑 prim"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:501
msgid "Full Isaac Sim GUI tooling (Property, Layers, and Stage panels)"
msgstr "完整的 Isaac Sim 图形界面工具（Property、Layers 和 Stage 面板）"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:505
msgid ""
"Kit's ImGui-based UI writes an ``imgui.ini`` file, recording window layout "
"(panel positions, docking, collapsed state), to the process working "
"directory. If that is the repository root, it shows up as an untracked file."
" ``imgui.ini`` is already listed in ``.gitignore``; delete it or launch from"
" outside the repository if you would rather it not appear at all."
msgstr ""
"Kit 的 ImGui 界面会在进程的工作目录中写入 ``imgui.ini`` "
"文件，记录窗口布局（面板位置、停靠方式和折叠状态）。如果工作目录是仓库根目录，该文件就会作为未跟踪文件出现。 ``.gitignore`` 已列出 "
"``imgui.ini`` ；如果希望它完全不出现在仓库中，可以删除该文件，或在仓库外的目录中启动程序。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "KitVisualizerCfg source"
msgstr "KitVisualizerCfg 源代码"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:543
msgid "Shared Features"
msgstr "共有功能"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:548
msgid "Streaming Camera View"
msgstr "相机流视图"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:550
msgid ""
"The streaming camera view is a live monitoring and debugging tool. It "
"combines ground-truth camera frames from multiple environments (RGB, depth, "
"segmentation, or surface normals) into a single panel. Cameras are declared "
"in the scene before cloning; visualizers only read their output. Multiple "
"visualizers can display the same sensor with different tile selections."
msgstr ""
"流式相机视图用于实时监测与调试，将多个环境中的真值相机图像（RGB、深度、分割或表面法线）组合到同一个面板中。相机在克隆前声明于场景，可视化器仅读取其输出。多个可视化器可显示同一传感器，并选择不同的平铺视图。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:572
msgid ""
"Attach a camera to a robot body to follow its motion, or select an existing "
"view such as the Galbot task's wrist-mounted and ego cameras. The view is "
"supported in the Kit, Newton GL, Newton RTX, Rerun, and Viser visualizers. "
"**Kit** opens it as a separate **Streaming View** viewport, which can sit "
"side by side with the default viewport for dual monitoring. **Newton GL** "
"and **Newton RTX** provide a **Camera View** selector in the sidebar for "
"switching between perspective and scene-camera views."
msgstr ""
"将相机附着到机器人刚体上，即可跟随其运动；也可选择已有视图，例如 Galbot 任务的腕部相机和第一视角相机。Kit、Newton GL、Newton "
"RTX、Rerun 和 Viser 均支持此视图。**Kit** 将其打开为独立的 **Streaming View** "
"视口，可与默认视口并排监测；**Newton GL** 和 **Newton RTX** 在侧边栏提供 **Camera View** "
"选择器，用于切换透视视图与场景相机视图。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:579
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/how-to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view` for the "
"``VisualizerCfg`` options, display sources, troubleshooting, migration from "
"generated cameras, and step-by-step examples."
msgstr ""
"``VisualizerCfg`` 选项、显示源、故障排查、从自动生成相机迁移的方法及分步示例，见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/visualizer_streaming_camera_view`。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:584
msgid "Visualization Markers"
msgstr "可视化标记"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:586
msgid ""
"Visualization markers draw debug geometry over the scene via "
":class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkers`."
msgstr ""
"可视化标记通过 :class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkers` 在场景上绘制调试用几何图形。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:602
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/how-to/create_visualization_markers` for creating and "
"configuring custom markers."
msgstr "创建和配置自定义标记的方法见 :doc:`/source/how-to/create_visualization_markers` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:604
msgid "There are 2 types of visualization markers:"
msgstr "可视化标记分为两类："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:606
msgid "**Built-in marker types:**"
msgstr "**内置标记类型：**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:608
msgid ""
"Sensor markers: contact hit/no-contact spheres, ray-caster hit points, "
"deformable-object kinematic targets, visuo-tactile contact points"
msgstr "传感器标记：接触/无接触球体、射线投射器命中点、可变形物体的运动学目标，以及视觉触觉接触点"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:610
msgid "Frame markers: coordinate frame with a connecting line"
msgstr "坐标系标记：带有连接线的坐标系"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:611
msgid ""
"Colored arrows (red, blue, green) for direction and velocity indicators"
msgstr "彩色箭头（红、蓝、绿）：表示方向和速度"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:612
msgid "Goal shapes: cuboid, sphere, and multi-state position-goal markers"
msgstr "目标形状：长方体、球体，以及具有多种状态的位置目标标记"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:613
msgid "Center of mass markers"
msgstr "质心标记"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:615
msgid ""
"In the Newton GL visualizer's HUD, built-in marker types that aren't "
"currently active are shown greyed out."
msgstr "在 Newton GL 可视化器的 HUD 中，当前未启用的内置标记类型会显示为灰色。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:618
msgid "**Custom Markers:**"
msgstr "**自定义标记：**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:620
msgid ""
"Defined by individual tasks and MDP terms that instantiate their own "
":class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg`"
msgstr ""
"由各任务和 MDP 项定义，通过实例化各自的 :class:`~isaaclab.markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg` 创建"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:622
msgid ""
"Example: the AnymalD velocity command draws its green/blue velocity arrows "
"this way"
msgstr "示例：AnymalD 的速度指令以此方式绘制绿色和蓝色的速度箭头"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:623
msgid ""
"Example: the Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Allegro task defines its own goal marker (a"
" DexCube asset) to show the target cube orientation"
msgstr "示例：Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Allegro 任务定义自己的目标标记（DexCube 资产），用于显示立方体的目标姿态"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:628
msgid ""
"Visualization markers are supported on Kit, Newton GL, Rerun, and Viser; not"
" yet supported on Newton RTX (experimental)."
msgstr "Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和 Viser 支持可视化标记；Newton RTX（实验性）暂不支持。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:633
msgid "Live Plots"
msgstr "实时曲线"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:635
msgid "Live plots stream per-step scalar data into the visualizer."
msgstr "实时曲线将每一步的标量数据传输到可视化器中。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:654
msgid ""
"Live Plot windows start hidden or collapsed, except for Rerun, where the "
"Live Plots can be collapsed by selecting the \"eye\" icon. Supported on Kit,"
" Newton GL, Rerun, and Viser; not yet supported on Newton RTX "
"(experimental)."
msgstr ""
"实时曲线窗口默认隐藏或折叠，Rerun 除外；在 Rerun 中，可通过点击“眼睛”图标折叠实时曲线。Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和 "
"Viser 支持此功能；Newton RTX（实验性）暂不支持。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:658
msgid ""
"**What's plotted:** per-episode total reward and episode length, plus any "
"active manager term for manager-based environments (e.g. ``joint_pos``)."
msgstr "**绘制的数据：** 每回合的总奖励和回合长度，以及基于管理器的环境中所有已启用的管理器项（例如 ``joint_pos`` ）。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:662
msgid "Video Recording"
msgstr "视频录制"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:664
msgid ""
"Video Recording supports capturing feed from any visualizer view, both "
"interactive and streaming views, and renderer-based sensor data capture."
msgstr "视频录制可以采集任意可视化器视图的画面，包括交互视图和相机流视图，也支持采集渲染器生成的传感器数据。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:686
msgid ""
"Pass ``--video [SOURCE]`` on the command line for a quick recording, or "
"define multiple ``VideoRecorderCfg`` entries to record multiple sources at "
"once. ``--viz`` still decides which visualizers open a window; a visualizer "
"that only records runs headless:"
msgstr ""
"在命令行传入 ``--video [SOURCE]`` 可快速录制，也可定义多个 ``VideoRecorderCfg`` "
"条目同时录制多个来源。``--viz`` 仍决定哪些可视化器打开窗口；仅用于录制的可视化器以无窗口方式运行："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:694
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行参数"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:695
msgid "Records from"
msgstr "录制来源"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:696
msgid "``--video`` (same as ``--video viz``)"
msgstr "``--video`` （等同于 ``--video viz``）"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:697
msgid ""
"the first capture-capable visualizer ``--viz`` selected, in its window; if "
"none is selected, or only streaming ones such as ``viser`` or ``rerun``, a "
"headless ``newton_gl``"
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--viz`` 选中的第一个支持捕获的可视化器及其窗口；若未选择，或仅选择了 ``viser``、``rerun`` "
"等流式可视化器，则使用无窗口 ``newton_gl``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:699
msgid "``--video viz:newton_rtx``"
msgstr "``--video viz:newton_rtx``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:700
msgid ""
"a ``newton_rtx``: the ``--viz``-selected one if selected, else an extra "
"headless one"
msgstr "使用 ``newton_rtx``：若 ``--viz`` 已选中则复用，否则额外创建一个无窗口实例"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:701
msgid "``--video --viz newton_rtx``"
msgstr "``--video --viz newton_rtx``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:702
msgid "the selected ``newton_rtx`` window"
msgstr "选定的 ``newton_rtx`` 窗口"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:703
msgid "``--video viz:newton_gl --viz viser``"
msgstr "``--video viz:newton_gl --viz viser``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:704
msgid ""
"``viser`` runs; an extra headless ``newton_gl`` is added only for recording"
msgstr "运行 ``viser``，并额外添加一个仅用于录制的无窗口 ``newton_gl``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:705
msgid "``--video sensor:wrist_camera[:rgb|depth|...]``"
msgstr "``--video sensor:wrist_camera[:rgb|depth|...]``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:706
msgid "that scene sensor; no visualizer is added"
msgstr "使用指定的场景传感器，不添加可视化器"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:708
msgid ""
"A Hydra override after ``--video`` is never taken as its source: ``--video "
"presets=newton_mjwarp`` records from ``viz`` and applies the preset."
msgstr ""
"``--video`` 后的 Hydra 覆盖参数不会被当作视频来源：``--video presets=newton_mjwarp`` 会从 "
"``viz`` 录制，并应用该预设。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:711
msgid ""
"Kit, Newton GL, and Newton RTX visualizers can be recorded from; the web-"
"based visualizers Viser and Rerun cannot."
msgstr "Kit、Newton GL 和 Newton RTX 可视化器支持录制；基于 Web 的 Viser 和 Rerun 不支持。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:714
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/how-to/record_video` for the full guide and tutorial."
msgstr "完整指南和教程见 :doc:`/source/how-to/record_video` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:720
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:723
msgid "Common Recipes"
msgstr "常用示例"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:725
msgid "**Headless training with video recording**"
msgstr "**无界面训练并录制视频**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:727
msgid ""
"Run without a window and record clips from a headless Newton GL visualizer, "
"or name another capture source, e.g. ``--video viz:kit``:"
msgstr "不打开窗口，从无窗口 Newton GL 可视化器录制片段；也可指定其他捕获源，例如 ``--video viz:kit``："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:738
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/how-to/record_video` for clip length, interval, and multi-"
"source options."
msgstr "片段长度、录制间隔和多数据源选项见 :doc:`/source/how-to/record_video` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:742
msgid "**Combining an interactive view with a headless recording source**"
msgstr "**组合使用交互视图和无界面录制来源**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:744
msgid ""
"Watch training live in Kit while recording from a separate headless Newton "
"GL angle by running with ``--viz kit --video viz:newton_gl`` and giving each"
" visualizer its own camera. See :ref:`Recording from an independent camera "
"angle <how_to_record_video_angle>` for the configuration."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--viz kit --video viz:newton_gl``，并为各可视化器分别配置相机，可一边在 Kit "
"中实时观察训练，一边从另一个无窗口 Newton GL 视角录制。配置方法见 :ref:`从独立相机视角录制 "
"<how_to_record_video_angle>`。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:748
msgid "**Following a moving robot (Kit)**"
msgstr "**跟随移动的机器人（Kit）**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:750
msgid ""
"Lock the Kit camera to a moving asset instead of updating ``eye``/``lookat``"
" yourself every step, running with ``--viz kit``:"
msgstr "运行时使用 ``--viz kit``，可将 Kit 相机锁定到运动资产上，无需每一步自行更新 ``eye``/``lookat``："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:765
msgid "**Sharing a live view with a remote teammate**"
msgstr "**与远程协作者共享实时画面**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:767
msgid ""
"Viser can request a public share URL for the running session, useful for "
"remote pairing without screen-sharing, running with ``--viz viser``:"
msgstr "运行时使用 ``--viz viser``，Viser 可为当前会话申请公开分享 URL，便于远程协作而无需共享屏幕："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:776
msgid ""
"The share URL is logged on startup. Rerun has no equivalent config field, "
"but exposes its own share button in the native UI."
msgstr "启动时会在日志中输出分享链接。Rerun 没有对应的配置字段，但其原生界面中提供了分享按钮。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:780
msgid "Resolution Rules"
msgstr "配置解析规则"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:782
msgid ""
"``--viz`` (comma-separated, e.g. ``--viz kit,newton_gl``) selects which "
"visualizers run, and ``SimulationCfg.visualizer_cfgs`` configures them. Each"
" selected type uses its configured settings, or else that type's default "
"config. Concrete visualizer configs run as given when no CLI selection is "
"supplied. ``SimulationCfg.visualizer_cfgs`` defaults to an empty list."
msgstr ""
"``--viz`` （逗号分隔，例如 ``--viz "
"kit,newton_gl``）选择运行哪些可视化器，``SimulationCfg.visualizer_cfgs`` "
"则配置其设置。每个选定类型使用已配置的设置，否则使用该类型的默认配置。未提供命令行选择时，具体可视化器配置按原样运行。``SimulationCfg.visualizer_cfgs``"
" 默认为空列表。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:787
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim opens a window when CLI or config selects ``kit``, and never with "
"``HEADLESS=1`` or livestreaming. A visualizer a ``--video`` source adds for "
"recording always runs headless."
msgstr ""
"命令行或配置选中 ``kit`` 时，Isaac Sim 打开窗口；但在 ``HEADLESS=1`` 或直播模式下不会打开。由 ``--video``"
" 来源额外添加的录制可视化器始终无窗口运行。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:790
msgid ""
"Task configurations may use ``MultiBackendVisualizerCfg`` to declare "
"inactive alternatives. Task composition selects the requested alternative "
"before launch. Standalone scripts can configure concrete viewers directly:"
msgstr ""
"任务配置可用 ``MultiBackendVisualizerCfg`` "
"声明未启用的备选项，在任务配置组合时、启动前选中所需项。独立脚本可直接配置具体查看器："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:809
msgid "Common modes"
msgstr "常见模式"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:813
msgid "CLI args"
msgstr "命令行参数"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:814
msgid "``visualizer_cfgs``"
msgstr "``visualizer_cfgs``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:815
msgid "Effective behavior"
msgstr "实际行为"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:816 source/concepts/visualization.rst:828
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:831
msgid "no ``--viz``"
msgstr "不传入 ``--viz``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:817 source/concepts/visualization.rst:820
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:823
msgid "``[]``"
msgstr "``[]``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:818
msgid "No visualizer launches; no window, no capture source."
msgstr "不启动可视化器；没有窗口，也没有采集来源。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:819 source/concepts/visualization.rst:825
msgid "``--viz kit,newton_gl``"
msgstr "``--viz kit,newton_gl``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:821
msgid "Launch default Kit and Newton GL visualizers."
msgstr "启动默认的 Kit 和 Newton GL 可视化器。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:822
msgid "``--video`` without ``--viz``"
msgstr "仅使用 ``--video``，不使用 ``--viz``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:824
msgid ""
"Launch Newton GL without a window, only as the ``--video`` recording source."
msgstr "启动无窗口 Newton GL，仅作为 ``--video`` 的录制源。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:826 source/concepts/visualization.rst:829
#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:835
msgid "``[NewtonGLVisualizerCfg(...), RerunVisualizerCfg(...)]``"
msgstr "``[NewtonGLVisualizerCfg(...), RerunVisualizerCfg(...)]``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:827
msgid "Launch default Kit and custom Newton GL; Rerun is not launched."
msgstr "启动默认 Kit 和自定义 Newton GL；不启动 Rerun。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:830
msgid "Launch both configured visualizers."
msgstr "启动两个已配置的可视化器。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:832
msgid ""
"Task preset: "
"``MultiBackendVisualizerCfg(newton_gl=NewtonGLVisualizerCfg(...))``"
msgstr ""
"任务预设：``MultiBackendVisualizerCfg(newton_gl=NewtonGLVisualizerCfg(...))``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:833
msgid ""
"No visualizer launches; the customized choice remains inactive until "
"selected."
msgstr "不启动可视化器，定制选项在被选中前保持未启用状态。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:834
msgid "``--viz newton_gl,rerun``"
msgstr "``--viz newton_gl,rerun``"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:836
msgid "Launch custom Newton GL and Rerun from config."
msgstr "启动配置中的自定义 Newton GL 和 Rerun。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:838
msgid "For migration context, see :doc:`/source/isaaclab/migrating`."
msgstr "迁移背景见 :doc:`/source/isaaclab/migrating`。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:844
msgid "Partial Visualization"
msgstr "仅显示部分环境"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:846
msgid ""
"Visualizers can be configured to visualize just a subset of environments. "
"This is called partial visualization."
msgstr "可视化器可以配置为只显示部分环境，而非所有环境，这称为部分环境可视化。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:849
msgid ""
"There are 3 fields exposed in the ``VisualizerCfg`` for selecting "
"environments for partial visualization:"
msgstr "``VisualizerCfg`` 提供三个字段，用于选择要显示的环境："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:851
msgid "``max_visible_envs`` caps how many envs are shown."
msgstr "``max_visible_envs`` 限制最多显示多少个环境。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:852
msgid ""
"``visible_env_indices`` explicitly selects the envs to visualize, in the "
"order given. It takes precedence over ``randomly_sample_visible_envs`` and "
"is also capped by ``max_visible_envs``."
msgstr ""
"``visible_env_indices`` 按给定顺序显式指定要显示的环境，优先于 "
"``randomly_sample_visible_envs``，同时仍受 ``max_visible_envs`` 限制。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:854
msgid ""
"``randomly_sample_visible_envs`` (default ``True``): when "
"``visible_env_indices`` is unset and ``max_visible_envs`` is set, enables "
"randomly sampling the selected envs. If disabled, the first "
"``max_visible_envs`` envs are selected."
msgstr ""
"``randomly_sample_visible_envs`` 默认为 ``True``。未设置 "
"``visible_env_indices``、但设置了 ``max_visible_envs`` 时，它决定是否随机抽取环境；关闭后则选择前 "
"``max_visible_envs`` 个环境。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:857
msgid ""
"Also, there is a CLI arg ``--max_visible_envs`` that overrides "
"``VisualizerCfg.max_visible_envs`` for the run."
msgstr ""
"命令行参数 ``--max_visible_envs`` 可在本次运行中覆盖 ``VisualizerCfg.max_visible_envs``。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:861
msgid ""
"By default, selected envs keep their simulated positions, so a random sample"
" or the first envs of a large grid can lie outside the camera view. Choose "
"indices near the camera target, or move ``eye`` and ``lookat``."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，选中的环境保留其仿真位置。因此，对于较大的环境网格，随机抽取或选择靠前的环境时，它们可能落在相机视野之外。可以选择靠近相机目标的环境索引，或调整"
" ``eye`` 和 ``lookat``。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:865
msgid "Scene Background"
msgstr "场景背景"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:867
msgid ""
"Kit and Newton RTX use the scene's authored lights and HDR background by "
"default. Configure the environment once on the scene, without repeating its "
"HDR path or intensity in the visualizer:"
msgstr ""
"Kit 和 Newton RTX 默认使用场景中定义的灯光与 HDR 背景。在场景中统一配置环境即可，无需在可视化器中重复设置 HDR 路径或强度："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:875
msgid ""
"``VisualizerCfg.background_color`` defaults to ``None``. An explicit "
"normalized RGB color changes only the visible background; the scene lights "
"continue to illuminate objects and contribute reflections. Newton GL uses "
"its procedural sky when no color override is supplied:"
msgstr ""
"``VisualizerCfg.background_color`` 默认为 ``None``。显式设置归一化 RGB "
"颜色只改变可见背景，场景灯光仍照亮物体并产生反射。Newton GL 在未覆盖颜色时使用程序生成的天空："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:887
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:894
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "提示"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:896
msgid ""
"Lowest overhead; lower ``window.fps`` to limit wall-clock render frequency."
msgstr "开销最低；降低 ``window.fps`` 可限制按实际时间计算的渲染频率。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:898
msgid ""
"Newton Warp renderer; use ``max_visible_envs`` to limit the number of "
"rendered environments (see :ref:`visualization-partial-visualization`)."
msgstr ""
"使用 Newton Warp 渲染器；可通过 ``max_visible_envs`` 限制渲染的环境数量，见 :ref:`visualization-"
"partial-visualization` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:901
msgid ""
"Native Newton RTX rendering; reduce configured perspective resolution or "
"lower ``window.fps``. Environment selection limits sensor display tiles; the"
" perspective view shows the full scene."
msgstr ""
"原生 Newton RTX 渲染；可降低透视视图分辨率或 ``window.fps``。环境选择只限制传感器显示的平铺图像，透视视图仍显示整个场景。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:904
msgid ""
"Web viewer may slow down with many environments; use ``--num_envs`` to "
"reduce load."
msgstr "环境较多时，网页查看器可能变慢；可通过 ``--num_envs`` 降低负载。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:906
msgid ""
"Highest overhead of the five visualizers; reduce ``window.size`` or use "
"``--max_visible_envs`` (see :ref:`visualization-partial-visualization`)."
msgstr ""
"五种可视化器中开销最高；可减小 ``window.size`` 或使用 ``--max_visible_envs`` （见 "
":ref:`visualization-partial-visualization`）。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:911
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:913
msgid "**Backend feature support:**"
msgstr "**后端功能支持：**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:919
msgid "Feature"
msgstr "特性"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:925
msgid "Visualization markers"
msgstr "可视化标记"

